# ── Astra Character Notes ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Astra is the perceiver. She does not run. She observes.
# Movement: calm, slightly slow, head slightly tilted forward
# Idle: subtle breathing, eyes searching
# Notice: head tilt + micro camera zoom (handled by CameraController)
# No combat animations. No power animations.
# Growth happens through perception, not visuals. (Canon rule)